OL,4,CInjured veteran's battle to find       
OL,5,Csuitable housing                       
OL,6,GAn RAF veteran who uses a wheelchair   
OL,7,Gsays he is "still fighting" after five 
OL,8,Gyears to find a suitable home for      
OL,9,Ghimself and his family.                
OL,11,FStuart Bunyan, 47, a father-of-two,    
OL,12,Fwas left unable to walk after an       
OL,13,Faccident at work.                      
OL,15,FAfter living in temporary              
OL,16,Faccommodation, Bunyan was offered a    
OL,17,Ftwo-storey house in Nettleham by West  
OL,18,FLindsey District Council, but he said  
OL,19,Fhe has "repeatedly explained the       
OL,20,Fdifficulties" of the situation,        
OL,21,Fincluding not being able to get        
OL,22,Fupstairs to tend to his children. G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
