OL,4,CBusiness owners' anger after shop      
OL,5,Cwindows smashed                        
OL,6,GBusiness owners said they feel         
OL,7,G"shocked", "terrified" and "gutted"    
OL,8,Gafter their shop windows were smashed  
OL,9,Gin Hull city centre.                   
OL,11,FOwner of hair salon Blunt the Space,   
OL,12,FMegan Spitter, shared on social media  
OL,13,Fthe moment a youth on a bike kicked    
OL,14,Fand shattered her window in Paragon    
OL,15,FArcade on Monday evening.              
OL,17,FIn the Old Town, owner of pet shop     
OL,18,FLili and Mila, Lisa Hall, shared a     
OL,19,Fphoto of her front window after it was 
OL,20,Fsmashed on 15 November.                
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
