OL,4,CRed tape killed Friday the 13th night, 
OL,5,Cbar says                               
OL,6,GThe owner of a cocktail bar says he    
OL,7,Gwas forced to cancel a movie night     
OL,8,Gbecause of red tape.                   
OL,10,FGeorge Drury, who runs George's        
OL,11,FCocktails, in Boston, Lincolnshire,    
OL,12,Fsold tickets for a screening of Friday 
OL,13,Fthe 13th, only to be told by the       
OL,14,Fborough council that the event would   
OL,15,Fbreak the law because he did not have  
OL,16,Fa licence to show films.               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
