OL,4,CKing's path could be moved to save     
OL,5,Ccaravans                               
OL,6,GPlans to safeguard dozens of caravans  
OL,7,Gfrom coastal erosion at a site in East 
OL,8,GYorkshire could see part of the King   
OL,9,GCharles III England Coast Path         
OL,10,Grerouted.                              
OL,12,FSkirlington Leisure Park has proposed  
OL,13,Fmoving 90 caravans at its site in      
OL,14,FSkipsea inland to protect them.        
OL,16,FIf the proposals are approved, the     
OL,17,Fcoastal path could to be moved         
OL,18,Fslightly inland for a short distance.  
OL,20,FThe plans will be considered by East   
OL,21,FRiding of Yorkshire Council.           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
